# Short links that tell the numbers page where a visit came from
# (2026-10-15). Use aethernal.app/ig in the Instagram bio, /tt in TikTok,
# /th on Threads, /fb on Facebook, /yt on YouTube, /dm in Instagram DMs.
# Add a name after the slash to tag one post: aethernal.app/ig/r-208.
#
# Status 200 serves the home page at that address with no redirect
# (Instagram distrusts bio links that redirect); the page itself reads the
# platform from the address. Assets use absolute paths so they load here.
/ig       /index.html   200
/ig/*     /index.html   200
/tt       /index.html   200
/tt/*     /index.html   200
/th       /index.html   200
/th/*     /index.html   200
/fb       /index.html   200
/fb/*     /index.html   200
/yt       /index.html   200
/yt/*     /index.html   200
/dm       /index.html   200
/dm/*     /index.html   200
